  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>My new digital DVD, Volume 54, is out today and covers statins, SIBO, moringa, appetite, and more. It is <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\">available</a> as a streaming video so you can start watching it immediately. Each video in this new collection will be released online over the next few months, available for free, but if you don’t want to wait, you can watch all of them by streaming <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\">right now</a>. </p>\n<div>And, remember, if you watch the videos on <a href=\"https://NutritionFacts.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NutritionFacts.org</a> or <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/NutritionFactsOrg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/NutritionFactsOrg\">YouTube</a>, you can access captions in several different languages. To find yours, click on the settings wheel in the lower-right of the video and then “Subtitles/CC.” Happy viewing!</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>If you are a $25+ monthly supporter, you’d be an expert on these new topics by now, having already received a complimentary link to the new download. If you’d like to receive them before they’re available to the public, please consider becoming a monthly supporter.<p></p>\n<p>Sign up on the <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/?mc_cid=1b9efb2a80&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/?mc_cid%3D1b9efb2a80%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1584030563671000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGoDoGzJPLB-mbmsd_JH22GbhQOrA\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/?mc_cid=1b9efb2a80&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\">donation page</a> to become a $25+ monthly contributor, and be given an opportunity to receive the newest downloads for free as long as your contributions are current.</p>\n<p>We’re so appreciative of each one of our donors. Without your support, we wouldn’t be able to continue our work. See what we were able to accomplish in 2020, thanks to you. Check out our <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.app.box.com/s/r59pk19mlqi2rb11bmrrylba5c3fklf4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Year in Review,</a> and please accept our gratitude.</p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Recipe: Berry Chocolate Chia Pudding</h4>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Berry-Chocolate-Chia-Pudding.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-67516 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Berry-Chocolate-Chia-Pudding-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Berry Chocolate Chia Pudding\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Berry-Chocolate-Chia-Pudding-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Berry-Chocolate-Chia-Pudding-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Berry-Chocolate-Chia-Pudding-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Berry-Chocolate-Chia-Pudding-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Berry-Chocolate-Chia-Pudding-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Berry-Chocolate-Chia-Pudding-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Berry-Chocolate-Chia-Pudding-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>This simple and decadent recipe comes from <em><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-die-cookbook/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The How Not to Die Cookbook</a></em>. Avocado and almond butter mix with cocoa to create a rich dessert. Get the free recipe <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/berry-chocolate-chia-pudding/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>, and watch how it’s made over on our <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/CLPX0uhAaYB/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/CLPX0uhAaYB/\">Instagram</a>.</p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Key Takeaways: Mental Health</h4>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Mental-Health.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-67518 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Mental-Health-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Key takeaways: mental health\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Mental-Health-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Mental-Health-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Mental-Health-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Mental-Health-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Mental-Health-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Mental-Health-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Mental-Health-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Mental-Health.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Mental health appears to play a part in physical health, so it’s crucial to eat foods that support both your mind and your body. Studies on the emotional health and mood states of those eating <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/plant-based-diets/\">plant-based diets</a> suggest that eating less meat may not only be good for us physically, but emotionally, too.<p></p>\n<p>Read more on our <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/mental-health/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">topic page</a> and check out our videos on mental health, including <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/foods-increase-happiness/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Which Foods Increase Happiness?</a> and <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/exercise-vs-drugs-for-depression/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Exercise vs. Drugs for Depression</a>.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Captions and Translation Accessibility Survey</h4>\n<p> </p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Translation-Survey-Square.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-67520 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Translation-Survey-Square-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Translation Survey\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Translation-Survey-Square-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Translation-Survey-Square-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Translation-Survey-Square-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Translation-Survey-Square-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Translation-Survey-Square-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Translation-Survey-Square-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Translation-Survey-Square-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/Translation-Survey-Square.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Did you know that all of our videos are captioned in English and the majority are also translated into multiple languages, thanks to our hard-working team of volunteers?</p>\n<p>We are conducting <a href=\"https://surveyhero.com/c/nfsurvey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">a survey</a> to find out how much you know about and access these captions and translations.</p>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://surveyhero.com/c/nfsurvey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">survey takes just a few minutes</a>, and your response will help us continue to improve our translations and captions to reach as many people around the world with this life-saving information. As a token of our gratitude, respondents will receive a discount code for DrGreger.org for completing the survey. Thank you in advance!</p>\n<p>P.S: If you have a strong background in professional translation and would like to help make this life-saving information more accessible in your language, <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/translators/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"http:// https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/translators\">please apply now</a>!</p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"> </p>\n<h4 data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Volunteer Spotlight: Mya Montgomery</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/mya2.jpeg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-67492 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/mya2-1024x1520.jpeg\" alt=\"Volunteer: Mya M\" width=\"200\" height=\"297\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/mya2-1024x1520.jpeg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/mya2-960x1425.jpeg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/mya2-768x1140.jpeg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/mya2-1200x1782.jpeg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/mya2-720x1069.jpeg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/mya2-540x802.jpeg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/mya2.jpeg 1242w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Each month I transcribe the questions from Dr. Greger’s live Q&amp;A’s for Facebook and YouTube so when people look at the video description on YouTube, they can see exactly what was covered that month. Previous to volunteering, I would tune in and learn so much! I decided I wanted to volunteer to help, and transcribing was a great way to learn and contribute to the community all at once.</p>\n<p>My favorite plant-based food is chickpeas. There are so many ways to eat them from just roasting them to making hummus. I eat them every weeknight in all kinds of different recipes! </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-60211\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png\" alt=\"Top 3 Videos of the Month\" width=\"460\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-768x248.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-720x233.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-540x174.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png 1108w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 460px) 100vw, 460px\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-14-Kombucha’s-Side-Effects-Is-It-Bad-for-You.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-66692 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-14-Kombucha’s-Side-Effects-Is-It-Bad-for-You-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Kombucha’s Side Effects: Is It Bad for You?\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-14-Kombucha’s-Side-Effects-Is-It-Bad-for-You-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-14-Kombucha’s-Side-Effects-Is-It-Bad-for-You-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-14-Kombucha’s-Side-Effects-Is-It-Bad-for-You-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-14-Kombucha’s-Side-Effects-Is-It-Bad-for-You-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-14-Kombucha’s-Side-Effects-Is-It-Bad-for-You-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-14-Kombucha’s-Side-Effects-Is-It-Bad-for-You-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-14-Kombucha’s-Side-Effects-Is-It-Bad-for-You-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-14-Kombucha’s-Side-Effects-Is-It-Bad-for-You.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/kombuchas-side-effects-is-it-bad-for-you/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kombucha’s Side Effects: Is It Bad for You?</a><br/>\nWhat are the risks versus benefits of drinking kombucha?</p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-66666 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The Best Diet for Fatty Liver Disease Treatment\" width=\"201\" height=\"113\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/01/53-13-The-Best-Diet-for-Fatty-Liver-Disease-Treatment.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 201px) 100vw, 201px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-diet-for-fatty-liver-disease-treatment/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Best Diet for Fatty Liver Disease Treatment</a><br/>\nWhat are the three sources of liver fat in fatty liver disease? How do you get rid of it?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/04/2.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-67118 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/04/2-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Flashback Friday: Are There Risks and Benefits of Energy Drinks?\" width=\"201\" height=\"113\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/04/2-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/04/2-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/04/2-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/04/2-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/04/2-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/04/2-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/04/2-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/04/2.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 201px) 100vw, 201px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/flashback-friday-are-there-risks-and-benefits-of-energy-drinks/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Flashback Friday: Are There Risks and Benefits of Energy Drinks?</a></p>\n<p>Red Bull, Monster, and Rockstar brand energy drinks are put to the test.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Live Q&amp;A on May 27</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-53879 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Live Q&amp;A\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Every month, I do a Q&amp;A live from my treadmill, and today, <em><strong>May 27</strong></em> is the day.</p>\n<p>Join on our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\">Facebook</a> page or <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\">YouTube</a> channel at 3pm EDT. I’ll be streaming to both at the same time!</p>\n<p>You can find links to past live Q&amp;As <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a> on NutritionFacts.org. If that’s not enough, remember, I have an <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">audio podcast</a> to keep you company, too.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></a></li>\n</ul>"
